      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>Cl</mi><mo>&#8857;</mo></mover><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow/></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>ClO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow><mo>&#8857;</mo></mover></math></p>",
